---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Private work reveal prototype
permalink: /private-preview/
restricted: true
noindex: true
---
<style>
.reveal-demo{--paper:#d3d4a7;--ink:#23281e;max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:48px 24px 80px;color:var(--paper)}
.reveal-demo .prototype-note{font:12px/1.6 'Space Mono',monospace;margin:0 0 32px;max-width:none}
.case-file{position:relative;isolation:isolate;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);overflow:hidden;min-height:530px}
.file-cover{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:530px;pointer-events:none}
.file-leaf{padding:44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--paper);transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1)}
.file-leaf:last-child{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
.file-label{font:12px/1.5 'Space Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}
.file-cover h1{font:600 clamp(48px,6.5vw,90px)/.94 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;letter-spacing:normal;margin:32px 0;max-width:6ch}
.file-cover p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;max-width:26ch;margin:0}
.file-controls{pointer-events:auto;margin-top:32px}
.file-button{appearance:none;font:600 16px/1.3 'Epilogue',sans-serif;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:0;padding:16px 20px;color:inherit;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:normal}
.file-button:hover{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}
.file-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px}
.file-inside{position:absolute;inset:0;padding:44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--paper)}
.file-inside[hidden]{display:none}
.file-inside h2{font:600 clamp(42px,6vw,80px)/1 'Bricolage Grotesque',sans-serif;letter-spacing:normal;max-width:13ch;margin:24px 0}
.file-inside p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;max-width:46ch;margin:0 0 24px}
.case-file.is-open .file-leaf:first-child{transform:translateX(-101%)}
.case-file.is-open .file-leaf:last-child{transform:translateX(101%)}
.case-file.is-open .file-cover{pointer-events:none;visibility:hidden;transition:visibility 0s .5s}
.reveal-explanation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;margin-top:32px}
.reveal-explanation p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;max-width:48ch;margin:0}
@media(max-width:650px){.reveal-demo{padding:24px 20px 48px}.case-file,.file-cover{min-height:650px}.file-cover{grid-template-columns:1fr}.file-leaf{padding:28px}.file-cover h1{font-size:60px;max-width:9ch;margin:24px 0}.file-leaf:last-child{gap:24px}.file-controls{margin-top:0}.file-inside{padding:28px}.reveal-explanation{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.file-leaf,.case-file.is-open .file-cover{transition:none}}
</style>
<section class="reveal-demo" aria-labelledby="reveal-title">
<p class="prototype-note">Local interaction prototype — authentication not configured</p>
<div class="case-file" id="case-file">
<div class="file-cover">
<div class="file-leaf"><span class="file-label">Shared for hiring conversations</span><h1 id="reveal-title">A closer look.</h1><span class="file-label">Private work / interaction study</span></div>
<div class="file-leaf"><span class="file-label">The details behind the decisions</span><p>Some work deserves a smaller audience. A simple opening, with room for the full story.</p><div class="file-controls"><button class="file-button" id="reveal-open" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="reveal-content">Preview the reveal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div></div>
</div>
<div class="file-inside" id="reveal-content" hidden tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="inside-title"><span class="file-label">Sample content — no private project material</span><div><h2 id="inside-title">Less friction.<br>More context.</h2><p>This fictional case-file interior demonstrates the transition only. In a finished portfolio, verified access would come before opening the cover and requesting restricted content.</p></div><button class="file-button" id="reveal-close" type="button">Close the case file <span aria-hidden="true">↙</span></button></div>
</div>
<div class="reveal-explanation"><p><strong>One clear action.</strong> No puzzle or password hunt. The cover moves aside quickly, leaving the work as the focus. Keyboard users can open, close, or press Escape; reduced motion removes the animation.</p><p><strong>Interaction, not authentication.</strong> This local sample contains no restricted assets, credentials, or access checks. A production version needs server-side access verification and protected asset delivery before this interaction can reveal real work.</p></div>
<noscript><p>This interaction preview needs JavaScript. No private content is included.</p></noscript>
</section>
<script>
(function(){
var file=document.getElementById('case-file'),open=document.getElementById('reveal-open'),close=document.getElementById('reveal-close'),content=document.getElementById('reveal-content');
function show(){content.hidden=false;open.setAttribute('aria-expanded','true');file.classList.add('is-open');content.focus({preventScroll:true});}
function hide(){file.classList.remove('is-open');content.hidden=true;open.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');open.focus({preventScroll:true});}
open.addEventListener('click',show);close.addEventListener('click',hide);file.addEventListener('keydown',function(event){if(event.key==='Escape'&&file.classList.contains('is-open')){event.preventDefault();hide();}});
})();
</script>
